      <profiles>
        <profile name="Xyclos Needler" id="afde-974b-90d6-a104" hidden="false" typeId="8e6f-7553-28c5-95a0" typeName="Weapons">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Range" typeId="9b9e-0c24-e409-a801">18&quot;</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Str." typeId="1ebc-896c-43de-904a">n/a</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="AP" typeId="730c-47dc-fdad-3c8b">6</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Type" typeId="1524-30c8-5da7-66ff">Assault 3</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Notes" typeId="45fd-0f50-e1d0-907c">This weapon always wounds on a D6 roll of 2+</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Rod of Torment" id="dbf0-bc81-5395-4ca7" hidden="false" typeId="1d88-1369-f0ed-b39c" typeName="Melee Weapons">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Ability" typeId="2113-98a2-4376-a94c">This is a close combat weapon. Any opposing model suffering one or more wounds from the Rod of Torment is immediately disabled by the pain and suffers Instant Death, regardless of toughness.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Enhanced Warriors" id="7c6f-5768-54c6-9c87" hidden="false" typeId="ccb3-7790-3139-7975" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="e24a-6018-20cf-d76c">If Fabius Bile is included in a force, he can enhance some of the warriors in the army through genetic manipulation and drugs. For +3 pts per model, any number of Chaos Space Marine squads can be &apos;enhanced&apos; by Bile&apos;s treatment. At the start of the battle, after both sides have set up but before the first turn takes place, roll a D6 for each enhanced squad and consult the table.


1: Berserk Rage! Make an Armour save for each warrior, removing any who fail. Survivors are Fearless and at +1 Strength for the remainder of the game.


2-5: Stable Mutation. The Enhanced warriors are Fearless and at +1 Strength for the entire game.


6: Created a Monster. The warriors are Fearless and add +2 to their Strength for the entire game. At the end of every owning player&apos;s turn, one of the squad&apos;s members is removed as a casualty (owner&apos;s choice).</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
    </selectionEntry>
